# Marketing site is not in git

- The BrewStore landing page lives in `/website/` locally and on **https://manishvagh.in/** (aaPanel).
- **Never** `git add`, commit, or push `/website/` or its assets, HTML, CSS, or deploy scripts.
- `/website/` is listed in `.gitignore` — keep it that way.
- LeadLock is at **https://manishvagh.in/leadlock/**; do not overwrite it when deploying BrewStore.
